["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"‘Holy grail’ of naked mole-rat research reveals how queens rule isopropyl myristate naked mole-rat super-puff intuitive gamer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-naturepod-裸鼹鼠女王不靠尿液-靠一种5美元分子维持王位/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>裸鼹鼠女王靠5美元分子统治：不是尿液，是护肤成分</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">裸鼹鼠的生殖抑制信号终于被找到：女王独产 isopropyl myristate。把它加进失去女王的群体就和平，停掉就爆发王位战；同一种分子还出现在哺乳期女性身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">裸鼹鼠</span><span class=\"tag\">化学信号</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！一年一度装x大会 old money 尖团音\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-cn2d7912-装逼能不能成-拿捏的是文化隔阂的远近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/570a4c2dc21c8b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>装逼能不能成，拿捏的是文化隔阂的远近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">装逼的本质是用最少信息快速立住人设：隔阂太近等于没装，隔阂太远对方看不懂，也等于白装。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">装逼文化</span><span class=\"tag\">阶层鄙视链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"172: Momenta IPO后再访曹旭东：就是想做没有尽头的AI world model RoboVan RoboTruck post-train data scaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-15-latetalk-智驾好和更好的行业-只容得下两三家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8cd6cf382873d1be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>智驾供应商终局只剩两三家，窗口年底关闭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Momenta 曹旭东判断，智驾像电池一样只有好和更好，三方供应商终局中国两三家、全球三四家；第一梯队市占率已90%，数据飞轮和量产是入场券，下一站是物理AI和家庭机器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CPU这个老登，竟然在智能体时代重新翻身了？ KV Cache RAS AMX PD分离 RDMA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-14-laoshi-智能体时代gpu常年堵车-cpu才是那套红绿灯系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5956a359adfacff7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">22:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0714</span></div>\n<h2>智能体时代GPU常年堵车，CPU才是那套红绿灯系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体把AI工作方式从并行概率预测变成串行任务执行，GPU因为缺乏分支预测和乱序执行能力而频繁空转，CPU的逻辑调度能力因此成了数据中心新的稀缺资源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Simplex Algorithm, Mathematical Details!!! simplex algorithm feasible region objective function slack variable Gaussian elimination ratio test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-13-statquest-线性规划最优解不在内部-单纯形法只沿边界顶点爬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa1aa79aeced790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">StatQuest</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0713</span></div>\n<h2>线性规划最优解不在内部：单纯形法只沿边界顶点爬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">线性规划的最优解总在某个边界顶点上，所以单纯形法不搜索区域内部：从原点出发，用最大负数列选方向、最小比率定步长，不断换到收益更高的相邻顶点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线性规划</span><span class=\"tag\">单纯形法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Brown – A deep but accessible introduction to general relativity equivalence principle fictitious / inertial force Schwarzschild radius / event horizon gravitational time dilation spaghettification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-dwarkesh-黑洞是效率-100-的发电厂-聚变只到百分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cb4dda1cfbcd52e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞是效率 100% 的发电厂，聚变只到百分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把砖慢慢吊到视界正上方再松手，静质能可以 100% 变成远处的功；化学燃烧只有百亿分之一、聚变只有百分之一，因为核反应根本碰不到质子中子的静质量，只有引力能碰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">广义相对论</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！如果可以，你会删除伴侣出轨的记忆吗？\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-cn2d7912-ai伴侣再完美也打动不了人-排斥非同类刻在基因里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0367758a99f46207-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侣再完美也打动不了人：排斥非同类刻在基因里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目里最被认可的一个解释是：拒绝完美AI伴侣不是因为它不够好，而是人类基因里对非同类的本能排斥，再完美也绕不过去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">爱情观</span><span class=\"tag\">AI伴侣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E243｜特朗普“缓刑”红牌之外，美国资本如何硬控全球足坛 Leveraged Buyout Asset Securitization Evergreen Fund Super League Matchday Revenue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-sv101-美国资本硬控足坛-不只买队-还在收租/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>美资控盘英超11队，靠的不是足球是金融</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美资已控盘英超11支球队，还把手伸进欧足联商业开发、版权分销和球员转会金融；版权费见顶后，它们靠推高估值和永续基金继续玩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育投资</span><span class=\"tag\">英超</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"269. 卷规模 VS 卷创作：真人短剧的两种生存模式 RY DIT 斩杀线 金手指\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-09-luanfanshu-月产-300-部短剧不靠灵感-靠本金安全与人物关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b655f3a7a4cc727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0709</span></div>\n<h2>短剧两种活法：规模流保本金，内容流靠人物关系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">短剧有两种活法：规模流靠本金安全与月产 300 部的确定性收益，内容流靠人物关系决定动机；两边都认为 AI 暂时取代不了真人的微表情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真人短剧</span><span class=\"tag\">产能管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ageing and Society pension credit means-tested benefits triple lock co-production Beveridge\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-07-thinkingallowed-英国两百万老人悄悄贫困-宁可对家人撒谎也不求助/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7854ea338f392d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Thinking Allowed</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0707</span></div>\n<h2>英国两百万老人悄悄贫困：宁可对家人撒谎也不求助</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">能拿到的养老金补贴，只有63%的老人真正去申请——挡住他们的不是没钱可领，而是不想让家人知道自己过得差，也怕把现有的一点都搭进去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养老金</span><span class=\"tag\">老年贫困</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E242｜最快半年AI跑通自进化？与陈天桥首席科学家聊聊硅谷模型必争之地 RSI Recursive Drift Heavy Duty Solver Discovery Model Agent Team\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-06-sv101-ai最快半年跑通自进化-验证与品味是最后门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0706</span></div>\n<h2>AI自我进化最快半年跑通，但模型会悄悄跑偏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 的拐点是模型能胜任长程任务。Apodex 首席科学家称最快半年跑通自我进化闭环，但递归漂移与模型品味仍需人类长期把关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI自进化</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 263: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 13 &quot;The Four Strands&quot; Part 4 - and final. universal explainer explanatory gap copper atom argument Conway&#x27;s Game of Life\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-04-tokcast-ai-至今没造出一个新理论-所以它不是人工人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0704</span></div>\n<h2>AI 至今没造出一个新理论，所以它不是人工人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Deutsch 的判据是：AI 只是把已知理论里没算完的部分填上，属于给有机化学图景涂色。要够到创造新知识的门槛，得先有问题——而 LLM 没有问题，问题是我们给它的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">认识论</span><span class=\"tag\">多世界解释</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Narcissists: Are We Surrounded? NPI NPD Grandiose narcissism Gray rocking Empathy prompt Triple E\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-02-sciencevs-没有自恋流行病-自恋者只是更痛苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">44:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0702</span></div>\n<h2>自恋流行病是媒体炒作：数据不支持，患者其实更痛苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">媒体热炒的「自恋流行病」缺少数据支持；NPI 测得的自恋水平近年反而在下降。真正的 NPD 约 1%，患者常伴抑郁焦虑，治疗有效但需数年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自恋</span><span class=\"tag\">NPD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Grant Sanderson – AI and the future of math grindability theory of mind RLVR Langlands Program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-30-dwarkesh-数学家未来是策展人-价值不在证明里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b8f892d1d8c883d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0630</span></div>\n<h2>数学家未来是策展人，价值不在证明里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 能解题、能解释、能证明定理；数学家的价值将转向判断哪条路值得走——并成为人们信任的策展人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 能力边界</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Charity Shops and Pocket Money quiet economy entitlements, payments and enterprise Mitumba\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-30-thinkingallowed-捐给慈善商店的衣物-七到九成从未在店里卖出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7854ea338f392d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Thinking Allowed</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0630</span></div>\n<h2>捐给慈善商店的衣物，七到九成从未在店里卖出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">慈善商店捐赠的衣物里，真正被卖给顾客的只占一到三成，其余大多出口到肯尼亚等地的二手市场，当地处理不了的部分最终被填埋或焚烧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零花钱</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善商店</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The next big breakthrough will be AIs learning on the job RLVR OPSD Dreaming KV cache Sample efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-26-dwarkesh-ai-的下一个突破-在工作中学习-而非仅靠训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd74222aed85378e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">19:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下一个突破不是训练，是让 AI 在工作中学习</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室押注 RLVR 能泛化出通用智能，但真正的瓶颈是样本效率与持续学习。OPSD 与「做梦」或成关键，让 AI 从部署中学习，而非只靠预训练。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">持续学习</span><span class=\"tag\">RLVR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！不借钱给朋友，就会失去朋友失去钱！ Hirox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-26-cn2d7912-罗永浩没跑路-是因为没提前把钱转出国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b223004bec41efc0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>罗永浩没跑路，是因为没提前把钱转出国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正跑路的企业家都是提前转移了财产的——罗永浩说自己没干这步棋，所以除了留下来一分一分把六七个亿还掉，别无选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业债务</span><span class=\"tag\">借钱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"82. 中国好美护，为何还没在欧洲火起来？ D2C JBP CPNP B Corp\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-25-cn677483-中国美妆出海欧洲-最烧钱的不是广告-是展会和经销商选错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360b57baaeb24d98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"出\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">出海进行时</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0625</span></div>\n<h2>中国美妆出海欧洲，最烧钱的不是广告，是展会和经销商选错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">参展费动辄几十万却签不到几个客户，经销商合作是欧洲品牌十年二十年起步的长期关系，选错一次代价可能是一整年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美妆出海</span><span class=\"tag\">欧洲市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"一期视频看懂物理AI：大模型这么强，为啥一到现实就翻车？ DSP PRU PQC CRA NPU Shift Left / 数字孪生\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-25-laoshi-物理世界没有撤销键-所以大模型指挥不动机械臂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/54fd853e8b527ba1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0625</span></div>\n<h2>物理世界没有撤销键，所以大模型指挥不动机械臂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聊天答错了可以重来，但汽车晚刹车一秒、机械臂走错一步就没有救场余地——真正扛起物理世界的，是藏在设备里几十年的嵌入式芯片，不是大模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">嵌入式芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP4 王强：AI 狂飙时代，一个古典的人 FOMO brain rot interdependence mindfulness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-23-xiaotianzhang-真格联合创始人王强-新出的书-他一本都不读/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdfe352669029443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>真格联合创始人王强：新出的书，他一本都不读</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的理由是：一本书今天被一亿人同时追捧，下个月可能只剩一千万人记得——畅销本身就是会被时间淘汰的证据，所以他把阅读时间全部留给经过几十年检验的旧书。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阅读方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI创业逻辑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Walt Disney Company Flywheel Multiplane camera Cel animation Pencil test Seven Powers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-22-acquired-迪士尼飞轮-艺术-商业与工程的百年复利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372eb871b3602a8b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:31:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>迪士尼护城河不是IP，是Walt的飞轮设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼的护城河不是IP本身，而是Walt将艺术与商业在脑中结合后，用工程手段打造的飞轮：高质量动画、最大化发行、注入辅助节点，再以数十年复利滚动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IP运营</span><span class=\"tag\">飞轮效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 10: Burnout vs Depression: The Mental Load of Mothers Burnout DSM Medicalization Benzodiazepines\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-15-parentmojo-妈妈不是病了-是社会病了-抑郁诊断如何转移问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">18:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>妈妈不是病了，是社会病了：抑郁诊断如何转移问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Burnout 被误诊为抑郁，问题被归因于个体大脑而非社会环境。新西兰研究发现，每天有人帮做家务六个月的产妇几乎不产后抑郁，但药物仍是首选方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抑郁诊断</span><span class=\"tag\">母亲 burnout</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"145. 口述SpaceX开发史：和前高管洪力德聊，马斯克用人观、最大IPO、太空与AI、人类文明扩张前奏？ reusable rocket SKU first principles Class Plus Elon Mafia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-zhangxiaojun-spacex-前高管-火箭不是目的-马斯克要的是整个太空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/055133beb1772443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>SpaceX 前高管：火箭不是目的，马斯克要的是整个太空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SpaceX 从不把自己当火箭公司，火箭只是手段。飞鹰一号成功后立刻退役，飞鹰九号把每公斤发射成本从两万美元压到三千美元，星舰目标一百美元以下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商业航天</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"发券、裂变、极速版，如何用红包设计增长？丨字节跳动 第8集 K因子 (K-factor) RY1/RY2/RY3 红包中台\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-luanfanshu-极速版的本质不是增长-是商业化和算法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42a856e6750ff434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">2:59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>极速版红包不是增长，是算法和商业化的收割机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人口红利消失后，红包、极速版、发券这套玩法的核心不是增长，而是用商业化和算法承接流量；AI时代买量接近失灵，增长回到模型能力与心智营销。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">用户增长</span><span class=\"tag\">极速版</span>\n</div></div></a>"]